        {
          "text": " Abaabaire babashangayo baabashonshomera; abazigu baabo baagira bati: Titwine rubanja, ahabw'okuba bakacumura ahari MUKAMA, obutaaho bwabo obw'amazima, kandi amatsiko ga baishenkurubo.",
