            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Reeba, nk'oku entare ejumbuka omu kishaka kya Yorudani kuteera eka y'entaama egumire, naanye nikwo ndibareetera kumuhunga ahonaaho, nkamureetera ou ndikwenda weena kumutegyeka. Mbwenu n'oha orikushushana naanye? N'oha owaakubaasa kunteeraho obunaku bw'okwiziramu? Ni muriisa ki owakunza omu kaso? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
